     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: OperationDefinition EpisodeOfCare-i-is-context-allowed</b></p><a name=\"EpisodeOfCare-i-is-context-allowed\"> </a><a name=\"hcEpisodeOfCare-i-is-context-allowed\"> </a><p>URL: [base]/EpisodeOfCare/[id]/$is-context-allowed</p><h3>Parameters</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Use</b></td><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Scope</b></td><td><b>Cardinality</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Binding</b></td><td><b>Documentation</b></td></tr><tr><td>IN</td><td>patient</td><td/><td>0..1</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html#Reference\">Reference</a></td><td/><td><div><p>If the user requesting context is a patient, then the patient input parameter should be specified.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td>IN</td><td>careTeam</td><td/><td>0..1</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html#Reference\">Reference</a></td><td/><td><div><p>If the user requesting context is a practitioner, then the careTeam input parameter should be specified.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td>OUT</td><td>return</td><td/><td>0..1</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/parameters.html\">Parameters</a></td><td/><td/></tr></table></div>"
